{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34468","headline":"王先辈草堂 · 陆龟蒙","name":"王先辈草堂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"松迳隈云到静堂，杏花临涧水流香。\n身从乱後全家隐，日校人间一倍长。\n金籙渐加新品秩，玉皇偏赐羽衣裳。\n何如圣代弹冠出，方朔曾爲汉侍郎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34468.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34468","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}